#offering is also known as sacrificing if that helps any. Corpses have 
to be pretty fresh, 50 turns, except for acid blobs, which count as 
"fresh" until they completely rot away, and the undead whoes which 
corpses aren't fresh to start with. The three things to avoid 
sacrificing are a unicorn of the same alignment as yourself, a member of 
your own race (unless you're chaotic) and former pet. If you're trying 
to appease an angry god, big monsters and unicorns of *other* 
alignments, work best. Otherwise it doesn't matter much.

